# Custom CAD models for this project's components.
#
# Drop ``.glb`` files here named after the registered type:
#   @register("my_holder")  →  CAD/my_holder.glb
#
# The runtime checks this folder first, then falls back to the
# platform-wide ``workspace/static/CAD/``. So if you have a model
# with the same name as a built-in, yours wins.
#
# Compression: this folder has its own ``compress.sh`` workflow
# (see ``workspace/static/CAD/compress.sh``) — copy it here if
# you want to Draco-compress your project-local GLBs.
